            "quote": "<p>I’m really happy that I made this choice after looking into purifying and distilling my water, I looked into electric ones and natural steam ones and found that both would cost a lot of time and energy waste by needing to purifying the water up to 4hrs at a time. I learned that the materials used in both options was of poor quality! </p>",
